OL,3,GNEWSADrivers face M25 diversion for
OL,4,Asecond weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are being warned of a diversion
OL,7,Fas an M25 junction will see slip road
OL,8,Fworks for a second weekend in a row.
OL,10,FSurrey County Council said the junction
OL,11,F11 clockwise exit slip road - in the
OL,12,FGatwick to Heathrow direction - will
OL,13,Fshut from 23:00 BST on Friday until
OL,14,F05:00 on Monday.
OL,16,FThe road near Chertsey will be
OL,17,Fexcavated to allow new drainage and
OL,18,Futility services to be laid.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
