OL,3,GNEWSADrivers face M25 diversion for
OL,4,Asecond weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This important upgrade to the M25
OL,7,Fjunction 11 will increase capacity and
OL,8,Fimprove traffic flows, particularly at
OL,9,Fpeak times," said Natalie Bramhall from
OL,10,FSurrey County Council.
